{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>With guile.</b> They asked them to circumcise, intending that they would not accept it upon themselves or that they would not be able to persuade the men of their city to do so." "<b>And they spoke because he had defiled.</b> They replied that the kinds of generosity that Shechem and his father had offered to do were no longer fitting now, after he had defiled — like the hire of a harlot."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:13.575703386Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}